            "sid": "EZK 9:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ani erumor eira ayong Akuj iremari ebala, “Taapuutu esi lu iriraate ere. Potu itingito ngiboro kus luaret.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.9.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.9.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 9:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Engolik ngitunga ngikan-kapei epote alowae alo a ekidor alo alokidiama, alo ingoliarit kwap, etingit itwaan daang iborosit keng niaret anakan. Arukito ka itwaan ni anapit eworu lokaanikan, etingit ibore ni igirio. Potu kesi daang towaa alokeno a ngakipeyos alo a asuat ananyang.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.9.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.9.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
